{
	'name': 'The SSB Queries (flat, random parameters)',
	'intro': 'This includes the 13 queries of the Star Schema Benchmark as templates with random parameters (generalization after Rabl et al., ICPE 2013): every predicate picks a random member of its hierarchy level or moves its range, so each query keeps the filter factor of the specification. The queries read the denormalized table lineorder_flat; year, month and week come from lo_orderdate.',
